Adding a New Language
=====================
  1. Copy i18n/locales/en.json to i18n/locales/<code>.json (use
     the right ISO code.) (en-pirate.json is an exception.)
  2. Translate every value. Keys must match exactly, or T() will
     silently fall back to English for that key.
  3. That's all. Available() picks up every file in locales/
     automatically at startup, no registration needed anywhere else.


Fallback Behaviour
------------------
- T(key, args...) looks in the currently selected language first.
- Missing key? Falls back to English.
- Missing there too? Returns the raw key itself, so a typo never
  crashes the wizard. Worst case you see a key name instead of text.
- SetLanguage(lang) silently falls back to English if lang isn't
  a loaded locale at all.
